{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C4\", \"C3\", \"C5\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C4\", \"C3\", \"C5\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C5\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C5\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C5\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"整体：C2的因果链最完整，既写出旧愿在行动中变近，也保留了依恋与责任并存、愿望尚未实现和最后松劲的余地；C1更紧凑但少了责任中的不羞愧和现实尚未改变的明确交代，C4内容较全却有重复，C3更利落但遗漏若干关键层次，C5最口语却删掉了太多实质内容。keep：C2最完整地保住了退回安宁无法解决问题、行动与牵挂合流、责任不抹掉依恋、努力不保证结果、旧快乐不白费、生活尚未回来、未来仍会动摇和不再靠拼命证明；C1次之，C4保留了温柔的代价、现实未变与仍愿行动，却没有充分保留不拿一种满足遮住另一种需要、不因心愿未成而否定旧快乐等内容，C3和C5遗漏的关键层次更多。cover：C2最能解释柔软为何随行动变得开阔有力，又为何高潮后仍有愿望未实现的疑问、对代价的担忧和逐渐松劲的余地；C1次之，C3对劲头退下与疑问未消的处理比C4更自然，C5对段内情绪变化的交代最少。lean：C1把旧愿靠近、牵挂推动行动和心里敞亮合在开头，后续各步大多增加新信息；C2把行动的发现与情绪的整合稍微拆成两步，C3略有重复但各步作用仍清楚，C5先报靠近再解释行动而略显绕，C4对现实未好转、生活未回来和努力不确定的重复最明显。plain：C5的眼前这一步、拖后腿和硬撑最像一个人在讲自己的事，C3也直接具体，C1稍有修辞但仍自然，C2的解释性略强，C4的句子较多，部分地方像整理好的心理分析。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ab1b18d3-de51-48e3-a810-77c2573b09a0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T215941200370Z", "elapsed_seconds": 252.984, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:03:54.207350+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "984bd237608da26db8612e8ee96117108a185b3a65862938ff5077284cf6321d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T215941200370Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "93a348fbdb019518a033b0a7bc4f78e474fdcf6723ea8103a326cf7a80ff0f4e"}}}
